pars-base (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release for ParsLinux 1.0 "Anatolian".
  * Integrated pars-branding visual identity.
  * Migrated default sound server to Pipewire (PulseAudio replacement).
  * Added core Turkish and international unicode font dependencies.
  * Added essential hardware abstraction, D-Bus and networking foundations.

 -- Pars Linux Developers <dev@parslinux.org>  Sun, 19 Oct 2026 21:00:00 +0300
